<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP SETS CENTRAL PARITY RATES FOR FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP SETS CENTRAL PARITY RATES FOR FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland set the central parity rate on Friday at 3.2221 zlotys per dollar and 1.8732 zlotys per mark, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
